    "created_at": "2024-12-18T16:28:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-18T16:28:26Z",
    "body": "To fully link things:\r\n* The 2D context creation algorithm for HTMLCanvasElement is [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#2d-context-creation-algorithm)\r\n* The offscreen 2D context creation algorithm is [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#offscreen-2d-context-creation-algorithm)\r\n\r\nThey share `alpha` and `colorSpace`. They do not share `desynchronized` or `willReadFrequently`.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
